{"type":"message","id":"768c1fe6","parentId":"a00d387d","timestamp":"2026-03-29T02:09:04.657Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need:\n\n1. Weather: Seoul is sunny, 15°C (feels like 15°C), 4km/h wind, 44% humidity\n2. System status: OpenClaw 2026.3.24 is running, healthy, 100% monthly quota remaining, session is a cron job for morning briefing\n3. Memory: \n   - 6 cron jobs are failing due to OAuth token refresh error (openai-codex provider)\n   - Need to run `openclaw providers auth refresh openai-codex` to fix\n   - Jobs affected: daily-security-audit, daily-update-check, daily-morning-briefing (this one!), daily-github-backup, notion-daily-briefing, github-repo-daily-briefing\n   - Yesterday there was a manual cron job execution request for service status check\n   - OpenClaw config validation error with unrecognized key \"default_model\" needs to be addressed\n\nNow I need to provide a sharp, helpful morning briefing in Korean (Sam prefers Korean first, and the daily briefing is in Korean). Let me format this concisely.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n# 🌅 아침 브리핑 - 3월 29일 일요일\n\n## 🌤️ 날씨 (서울)\n- 맑음 ☀️\n- 기온: 15°C (체감 15°C)\n- 바람: 북풍 4km/h\n- 습도: 44%\n- 전반적으로 쾌적한 날씨입니다.\n\n## 💻 시스템 상태\n- **OpenClaw 버전:** 2026.3.24 (정상 운영 중)\n- **월 할당량:** 100% 남음 (4월 7일까지)\n- **토큰 사용량:** 95% 남음 (약 4시간 35분)\n- **캐시 적중률:** 78%\n- **세션:** cron daily-morning-briefing 활성\n\n## ⚠️ 긴급 알림\n\n### 1. OAuth 토큰 만료로 크론 잡 실패 (긴급)\n- **영향 받는 작업 (6개):**\n  - daily-security-audit\n  - daily-update-check\n  - daily-morning-briefing\n  - daily-github-backup\n  - notion-daily-briefing\n  - github-repo-daily-briefing\n  \n- **해결 방법:** \n  ```bash\n  openclaw providers auth refresh openai-codex\n  ```\n\n### 2. OpenClaw 설정 오류\n- **문제:** `default_model` 키가 설정 스키마에 없음\n- **해결 필요:** 설정 파일에서 제거 또는 수정 필요\n\n### 3. 어제 활동 요약\n- 크론 잡 상태 확인을 위한 수동 실행 요청됨 (11:05 AM)\n- 8개 작업 중 7개가 큐에 등록됨\n- openclaw-control-ui 인터페이스를 통한 요청으로 확인됨\n\n---\n\n**우선순위:** OAuth 토큰 갱신 후 설정 오류 수정 권장"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":281,"output":964,"cacheRead":23413,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24658,"cost":{"input":0.0001686,"output":0.0021208,"cacheRead":0.00257543,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0048648300000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774750133707,"responseId":"202603291008561a419406dfeb40d8"}}
